// Public entrypoint for @tevm/effect — Effect-native, aggressively dependency-injected
// TEVM powered by ZEVM and Voltaire.
//
// Zero Node.js / platform imports live here: import `@tevm/effect/platform/node` for
// Node-API native ZEVM bindings & Node HTTP server, `@tevm/effect/testing` for the pure
// in-memory backend, or `@tevm/effect/voltaire` for full @tevm/voltaire & voltaire-effect v2 integration.

